Official release
----------------
Sine Nomine publishes the SRD as a free PDF (94 pages, dated 3/13/24) on DriveThruRPG:
https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/473939/worlds-without-number-system-reference-document
The PDF download needs a DriveThruRPG account, so it was not downloaded or compared.
The mirror markdown is a third-party transcription of that PDF.

