Verification
------------
Compared against the official SRD PDF (98 pages, created 2024-03-12) on 2026-10-02.
The prose matches; 26 table cells or phrases differ. Errors that affect extracted
data are corrected in tools/srd-extract/errata.json, which cites the PDF page for
each, and are applied when the files are read. These files are not edited for them.

Local changes
-------------
Two passages were removed because they are not SRD text, so the CC0 waiver does not
cover them:

1. index.md: the "An Introduction from the Site Manager" section (6 lines), written
   by the mirror's author.
2. 1.0 Character Creation/1.5.0 Class List/1.5.2 The Accursed.md: the "Arts Gained at
   each level" table (13 lines, between "Accursed arts may be used in or out of
   armor." and the Accursed Blade entry). The official SRD has no such table; it may
   come from the copyrighted WWN rulebook.

Every other file is byte-identical to the commit above.
